    "SnapUp Events may use browser storage that is necessary to keep you signed in, remember security state, preserve an intended destination after login, and provide requested functionality. For example, an authentication token may be stored under a local browser key such as": "SnapUp Events kan bruge browser opbevaring, der er nødvendig for at holde dig logget ind, huske sikkerhedstilstand, bevare en tilsigtet destination efter login, og give den ønskede funktionalitet. en godkendelsestokke kan f.eks. gemmes under en lokal browsernøgle, f.eks.",
