    "These terms explain the rules for creating events, joining shared galleries, uploading memories, and using SnapUp Events responsibly.": "Disse vilkårene forklarer reglene for å skape hendelser, bli med i delte gallerier, laste opp minner og bruke SnapUp Events ansvarlig.",
