    "This policy does not cover third-party websites or services linked from the Service, nor an organizer’s independent use of media after downloading or exporting it.": "ta pravilnik ne zajema spletnih mest ali storitev tretjih oseb, povezanih s storitvijo, niti neodvisne uporabe medijev po prenosu ali izvozu.",
