    "These terms explain the rules for creating events, joining shared galleries, uploading memories, and using SnapUp Events responsibly.": "Masharti haya yanaelezea sheria za kuunda matukio, kujiunga na nyumba za pamoja, kupakia kumbukumbu, na kutumia SnapUp Events kwa uwajibikaji.",
    "Table of contents": "Sehemu ya Maudhui",
