    "Optionally choose a cover photo. It will appear only after guests verify the event code or scan its QR code.": "Chaguo la kuchagua picha ya kifuniko itaonekana tu baada ya wageni kuthibitisha msimbo wa tukio au skanning msimbo wake wa QR.",
    "Choose a clear cover photo for your event. It will appear when guests join with the code.": "Chagua picha ya kifuniko wazi kwa tukio lako. Itaonekana wakati wageni wanajiunga na msimbo.",
